game genre with updated mechanics and graphics.<br></li><li><strong>Live Action Cut Scenes:</strong> Experience puzzle solving with live action presentation cut scenes and enjoy the moment.<br></li><li><strong>Action Movement Puzzles:</strong> Some puzzles require your hand eye coordination to survive or solve the puzzle.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/322580/extras/bd6b53f513b3ddf566f6402aa41e6f5f.avif?t=1447363599\" width=616 height=346 /></span>",
